 is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}(A) & =\\begin{vmatrix}-\\frac{4}{9} & -\\frac{4}{7} \\\\ \\frac{2}{7} & -\\frac{8}{3}\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =-\\frac{4}{9}\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{8}{3}\\right)-\\left(-\\frac{4}{7}\\right)\\cdot \\frac{2}{7} \\\\  & =\\frac{32}{27}-\\left(-\\frac{8}{49}\\right) \\\\  & =\\frac{1784}{1323}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186510576 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c0e44b6c-314a-5501-9b95-06b4d75b5730" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{513}{140}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510581}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c0e44b6c-314a-5501-9b95-06b4d75b5730" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{513}{140}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510581} :answer-field/id #uuid "23459979-cbd9-5238-a961-af2acea3f96e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510571}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "554f7f1f-b6ff-5426-9de0-5f0d3de16c53" :question/problem "Calculate $det(A)$ given that\n$$\n\\displaystyle A=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{7} & \\frac{7}{3} \\\\ -\\frac{9}{5} & -\\frac{5}{4}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n$det(A)=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}(A) & =\\begin{vmatrix}\\frac{3}{7} & \\frac{7}{3} \\\\ -\\frac{9}{5} & -\\frac{5}{4}\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{7}\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{5}{4}\\right)-\\frac{7}{3}\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{9}{5}\\right) \\\\  & =-\\frac{15}{28}-\\left(-\\frac{21}{5}\\right) \\\\  & =\\frac{513}{140}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186510583 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e5c3e732-c3bb-5b5f-b786-d49ab1ea186a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{113}{210}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510582}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e5c3e732-c3bb-5b5f-b786-d49ab1ea186a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{113}{210}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510582} :answer-field/id #uuid "25acb654-19ec-53d5-9cf7-5fa54e4d05cf" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510572}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "f71665cc-a4c6-5094-b683-7caeca8eef3e" :question/problem "Calculate $det(A)$ given that\n$$\n\\displaystyle A=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{6}{7} & \\frac{4}{3} \\\\ \\frac{5}{8} & \\frac{8}{5}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n$det(A)=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}(A) & =\\begin{vmatrix}\\frac{6}{7} & \\frac{4}{3} \\\\ \\frac{5}{8} & \\frac{8}{5}\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{7}\\cdot \\frac{8}{5}-\\frac{4}{3}\\cdot \\frac{5}{8} \\\\  & =\\frac{48}{35}-\\frac{5}{6} \\\\  & =\\frac{113}{210}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186510588 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0d5e3df0-85d2-5ce9-9855-4bdaf54f8004" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-70" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510587} {:answer/id #uuid "2aed96b6-7ace-511d-abfe-a057b9d6196b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "213" :db/id #e